        "text": "[{\"y\":0.6293159609326453,\"x\":0.17400419116630286,\"text\":\"Formed in the beginning of 1959, the\",\"width\":0.3312369029923419,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.6188493127849327,\"x\":0.13194567355122883,\"text\":\"Life Guard Club of our school has quite\",\"width\":0.3734641590997619,\"height\":0.01306324067255582},{\"y\":0.6031976743315681,\"x\":0.12997903164604688,\"text\":\"a long history. Last year （1969） the club\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"y\":0.5915309446109587,\"x\":0.1299790432481587,\"text\":\"had a lot of activities.\",\"width\":0.2054507236713973,\"height\":0.011726384364820763},{\"y\":0.571220929961413,\"x\":0.17190776830478893,\"text\":\"In the beginning of the year the club\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"y\":0.5572248252289156,\"x\":0.12987300330764193,\"text\":\"had a Joint Party which was held in the\",\"width\":0.37545428989299146,\"height\":0.01548374188451107},{\"y\":0.5465116280081164,\"x\":0.12788260148532604,\"text\":\"school hall.\",\"width\":0.10482180174632894,\"height\":0.011627906774464902},{\"y\":0.5260586317951641,\"x\":0.17400420792743046,\"text\":\"During the whole summer vacation，\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.5130293159461181,\"x\":0.12997903164604688,\"text\":\"with the help of Br. Lawrence Thoo, a\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.500000000213351,\"x\":0.12997902984311202,\"text\":\"swimming training course was given to the\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.486918605052433,\"x\":0.1278826145856817,\"text\":\"students of the school by the club. About\",\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.013081394655308443},{\"y\":0.47231270350337917,\"x\":0.12788259269702115,\"text\":\"fifty boys of the lower forms learnt how to\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014657980456025954},{\"y\":0.45872668664970717,\"x\":0.1270483068272241,\"text\":\"swim.\",\"width\":0.052813320931464236,\"height\":0.015628598489668133},{\"y\":0.44186046568106674,\"x\":0.17190776096726298,\"text\":\"On 15th June the club sent a team of\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.013188394428464423},{\"y\":0.4273255816112993,\"x\":0.127882595485281,\"text\":\"nine life gquards to the March Past of Ser-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013081394655308443},{\"y\":0.41253269011028537,\"x\":0.12773823159277278,\"text\":\"vice Teams at Repulse Bay. Our team per-\",\"width\":0.3776526464568145,\"height\":0.01539000470785823},{\"y\":0.3996742669675638,\"x\":0.12788259511638658,\"text\":\"formed quite well during the competition.\",\"width\":0.37316561507819856,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.37936046514552146,\"x\":0.1719077697163893,\"text\":\"On 14th July a launch picnic, spon-\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"y\":0.3661237784466026,\"x\":0.12788260055865613,\"text\":\"sored by the club, was held at Clear Water\",\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"y\":0.3530944626922101,\"x\":0.12997903070789177,\"text\":\"Bay. Here we would like to thank Mr. Yu\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.011731118565661891},{\"y\":0.3380958383078809,\"x\":0.12782815877646844,\"text\":\"Pui Lam for his generous help.\",\"width\":0.27264556454131883,\"height\":0.014215300370505224},{\"y\":0.31530944628340063,\"x\":0.16771489378898752,\"text\":\"Last summer our club sent many duty\",\"width\":0.33752619401531636,\"height\":0.016085902409755493},{\"y\":0.30521172641750216,\"x\":0.12788260547915242,\"text\":\"patrols to the popular beaches, swimming\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.011726384364820763},{\"y\":0.2921511628841813,\"x\":0.12788260547915242,\"text\":\"pools and picnics organised by the Soclal\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.010174418272335228},{\"y\":0.27616279042652936,\"x\":0.1278826134456091,\"text\":\"Welfare Department and private societies.\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"y\":0.2630813950776921,\"x\":0.1278826084141627,\"text\":\"We also got Pool service at Victoria Pool\",\"width\":0.37735846619054264,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"y\":0.24770510469724494,\"x\":0.12557361590464186,\"text\":\"at our school's Annual Swimming Gala.\",\"width\":0.3569543215876353,\"height\":0.01977495448208788},{\"y\":0.23255813958757388,\"x\":0.16771488478828891,\"text\":\"In October a team of six entered the\",\"width\":0.33752619401531636,\"height\":0.011741534428798328},{\"y\":0.21793776886459626,\"x\":0.12768486121493947,\"text\":\"Cross Harbour Race.\",\"width\":0.1890747271274915,\"height\":0.013252368889724808},{\"y\":0.2165697676251075,\"x\":0.33333333220261124,\"text\":\"They were Edward\",\"width\":0.17190775687360366,\"height\":0.013081394655308332},{\"y\":0.20316567644961736,\"x\":0.12571281759108266,\"text\":\"Man, George\",\"width\":0.11754711506395885,\"height\":0.013726787380752836},{\"y\":0.20099155815296843,\"x\":0.24417605791160663,\"text\":\"Cheng，\",\"width\":0.07592231556703094,\"height\":0.01736221686248285},{\"y\":0.2019543973074457,\"x\":0.320754716674934,\"text\":\"Patrick Liang, Leo\",\"width\":0.18448636762846887,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.18892508127429097,\"x\":0.12578616039714166,\"text\":\"Chong, James Loh and Philip Yu.\",\"width\":0.31027253259495535,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.17877906995782467,\"x\":0.1257861704826472,\"text\":\"members of the club\",\"width\":0.19916141829396464,\"height\":0.010174418272335228},{\"y\":0.17587209329734577,\"x\":0.3249475855369166,\"text\":\"also participated in\",\"width\":0.18029350216166662,\"height\":0.013081394655308332},{\"y\":0.1612377848429044,\"x\":0.12578617942094406,\"text\":\"the Marathon Life Saving Race.\",\"width\":0.3165618236179298,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"y\":0.14680232555249828,\"x\":0.12578616745954652,\